{"ref":"BDB, חֶ֫מֶר","hw":"חֶ֫מֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫מֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>wine</strong> (poet.) <strong>(</strong>Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܰܡܪܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמְרָא</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">خَمْرٌ</span>, v. Lag<sup>BN 207</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">וְדַם־עֵנָב תִּשְׁתֶּה־חָ֑מֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.14\">Dt 32:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּרֶם חֶמֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.2\">Is 27:2</a>, but read here <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּרֶם חֶמֶד</span> (v. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶמֶד</span>).","next":"BDB, חֵמָר","prev":"BDB, חָמַר"}